&lt;p style="line-height: 16px; text-align: right"&gt;3,000百万円&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height: 1.33px"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 128px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 0px none ; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 0px none ; border-bottom: 0px none "&gt;
&lt;p style="line-height: 16px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;取得原価&lt;/p&gt;
